  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 聊一聊，疗一疗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6606770c2d9eae5d0ace14ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6606770c2d9eae5d0ace14ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Mar 2024 08:08:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们请到了灵气疗愈师xindi和我们一起聊了聊大家的春季近况</span></p><span></span><p><span>前半部分主播们分享鸡零狗碎的近况，后半部分是xindi给我们做的疗愈过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 小甄首次勇闯传统大厂，就错失50万奖金😭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 职场失意，情场也得意不了一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 恋爱中的卡卡卡卡卡卡点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 玄学疗愈从小甄的七个脉轮开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4322">01:12:02</a> 看看工作，还是开心重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4732">01:18:52</a> 一个升华的结尾，迎来了一点迷之感动</span></p><span></span><p><span>拖更好久，都怪地磁暴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后结尾介绍下xindi的首饰品牌：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Little creatures是一个关注自然和未来以及一切微小而坚强事物的首饰品牌。希望通过自然观察、神秘学研究，创造一个充满治愈能量的世界，希望这些充满生命力的设计、水晶宝石，让佩戴者一次又一次感受到生命的愉悦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>头图源于网络；音乐来自吴卓玲Midnight River</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqjTG1TrWIF1ouPFW5jTqFPcxRQN.m4a" length="126262945" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqTXdhN28tOVYwUFI4b2pTV2V1dUNRdldsSEUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 主播全体被裁员，这档播客太适合接裁运了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645d172e306513184cb87612</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645d172e306513184cb87612</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 May 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">3:39</a> 得知被裁员信号的时候在想啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">4:56</a> 拿到大礼包之后想怎么花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">6:06</a> 大礼包一时爽，找工作火葬场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 对下一份工作提点需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 劳动女性大毛无缝衔接，已经上岗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 人生第一次领大礼包的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 普法时间：未休年休假需要支付三倍工资报酬（主播嘴瓢说成n+1了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 裁员也不是人人都能云淡风轻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 找工作会有年龄焦虑吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 还是得喜欢的人一起工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 为找新工作做了哪些努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> 一些求职小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a> “你怎么30岁了还在写简历？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>三位主播被裁两个月了，心情既没有万念俱灰，也没有自由自在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但如果再选一次的话，我们应该还是会选择被裁员吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一个主播百分百裁员率的播客，想被裁的朋友们来我们评论区接裁运吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝想被裁和不想被裁的大家都心想事成~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvmF-YAoP4H6ZjudEc56H5tSmWxJ.m4a" length="71668909" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2ejR0MWZ4eFV3eGVYWnBualdfTEhCN2JBNUgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.4 春天我想谈恋爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643eafff66e4c00c6a722f59</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643eafff66e4c00c6a722f59</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听唯姨豆奶第四期，本集题图来自「My盛Lady」</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天到了，谁还不想谈个恋爱呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">5:14</a> 磨刀不误砍柴功，为了谈恋爱都努努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">9:44</a> 想谈恋爱是有多想？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 谁还没有为爱搞迷信呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 一些暧昧的零零碎碎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 学生时期，谁还不是个恋爱奇行种呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 让关系升温，给约会拱火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 不知道能不能谈上理想型，但可以先想想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3021">50:21</a> 真的无法喜欢上顶级帅哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> 理想中的恋爱模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3684">1:01:24</a> 成年人的恋爱拉锯：到底要不要告白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4009">1:06:49</a> 说完告白来说说分手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4195">1:09:55</a> 如何科学吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span>【重磅猛料&amp;无奖竞猜】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目录制1个月之后，三位主播其中一位正式脱单了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家猜猜是哪位（1000粉也敢玩粉丝互动，也是大胆</span></p><span></span><p><span>答案在下期公布</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是祝听到这期节目的朋友都能顺利脱单~</span></p><span></span><p><span>（来自上传人士的小声bb：没想到我们是情人节录的，并且现在春天已经快结束！）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luTSdiSkCVmkgpx29p857_Twcql4.m4a" length="108021581" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzODN3a19YUVRyaWozeURYUkpOQzdoeGt5a0QucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.3 被少数群体的爱情故事吓晕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f372de0d7e8eaa720f8084</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f372de0d7e8eaa720f8084</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Feb 2023 13:17:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听唯姨豆奶第三期，本期我们请到性少数朋友分享他们或狗血或悲惨或浪漫的爱情故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 谁没谈过一次迷惑的异性恋呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 在三蹦子上垂泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> 社恐拉子聚餐偶遇狼性T觅食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> “分TP”“贴标签”你觉得恨却离不开&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 在拉圈当局外人，在gay吧站如喽啰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 我是一朵不配被等的苦涩玫瑰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 幸福真的太小，太难得了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">1:05:05</a> 为什么直女总是错爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4996">01:23:16</a> 遭到了古风男的埋伏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5406">01:30:06</a> 还是渴望长久的幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span>录了很久，各种原因，终于曲折上线了😭</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llAmxuaHl-7tvUSyT_MPHg1ns4Nk.m4a" length="148002709" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:41:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xxdHNTb2ltQTM3Umd0ZUgtcnFPVVc5MTFlV0UucG5n.png"/>
