  <item>
    <title>Vol.2 朋友，要进入我们的省钱妙妙屋吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62db9b0b64f141ad81501823</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62db9b0b64f141ad81501823</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Jul 2022 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>蛤蟆之声更名唯姨豆奶后的第一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们邀请了省钱王爵小李跟我们一起聊了聊省钱和恋爱的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a>电商羊毛好难薅羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a>会介意约会的异性用优惠券吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a>可以接受伴对象的收入和自己差距很大吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a>大家有啥大件消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a>省钱小窍门分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a>节省在交友方面其实是加分项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a>谈恋爱花钱那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a>情侣之间的送礼指北</span></p><span></span><p><span>「好消息不断」</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期录制之后，我们和嘉宾小李建立了紧密的灵魂链接，随即将他直接发展成了主播。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是嘉宾“小李”成为主播后更名“小甄”，正式出道。</span></p><span></span><p><span>唯姨豆奶霎时人丁兴旺，蓬荜生辉了！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhOv1B5sUD8Nky0sqGBLLfXkPAaW.m4a" length="90295137" type="audio/mp4"/>
